[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187509513","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118107#issuecomment-4187509513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118107","id":4187509513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75mFMJ","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-04T18:05:48Z","updated_at":"2026-04-04T18:05:48Z","body":"Cannot reproduce in Linux under `v4.6.1.stable` and `v4.7.dev3`.\n\nI assume the only input being done here is mouse movement and clicks? No modifier keys being pressed? If you can reproduce it reliably, can you confirm if disabling snapping fixes the issue?\n\n<img width=\"1140\" height=\"387\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/745ef796-f335-44ab-9fa4-dda2b120a2b8\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187509513/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188068515","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118107#issuecomment-4188068515","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118107","id":4188068515,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75oNqj","user":{"login":"rinevard","id":136295900,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB-13A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136295900?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard","html_url":"https://github.com/rinevard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T01:36:32Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T05:59:41Z","body":"No modifier keys being pressed. Disabling snapping doesn't fix the issue.\nI tested this with a new AnimationPlayer and found something new. \n1. At 0:10 in the video below, when I select a key and create a new key left to it and drag it for the first time, the key behaves correctly, but the timeline cursor jumps to time 0. \n2. Then I delete the key and do the same thing again, the bug appears.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95075b59-4a20-4fce-b434-e438566b5d9a","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188068515/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188670679","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118107#issuecomment-4188670679","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118107","id":4188670679,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75qgrX","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T10:29:35Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T10:29:35Z","body":"Thanks for the video! Following it more closely, I've managed to replicate it (`v.4.6.2.stable` & `v4.7.dev3`), and from my experiments it seems to only occur when the first point is selected before creating a new point:\n\n|Not selected|Selected|\n|-|-|\n|<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64bda98b-30cd-4159-8904-a2ae08da52bf\">|<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/836a575c-da14-47cb-8394-91ea7d31b46c\">|\n\nAlmost certain that the issue is that when moving the new point while the old one was selected, it is using the old point's position as the starting point. The \"delta\" when moving the new point is the exact same of the observed bug, when applied over the old point (or in other words, it's as if Godot mistakenly assumes we're moving the old point instead) ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188670679/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4191054810","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118107#issuecomment-4191054810","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118107","id":4191054810,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75zmva","user":{"login":"rinevard","id":136295900,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB-13A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136295900?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard","html_url":"https://github.com/rinevard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-06T08:07:44Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T08:07:44Z","body":"The issue is due to `selection` not being updated correctly after insertion. Selection stores `key`(which is an index) and `pos`(which is the key's time), and inserting a key to the left shifts indices while not rebuilding the selection, so the index and cached position in `selection` no longer refer to the same key. I'm working on a fix.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4191054810/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]